{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Ultra Labels (so rotulos, fundo transparente)",
  "metadata": {
    "ultra:desc": "Estilo SO-DE-ROTULOS servido pelo tileserver proprio, para compor os NOMES de rua/avenida/bairro POR CIMA do choropleth dos mapas de calor. Substitui o tileset only-labels do CARTO (BLK-BASEMAP-06). Sem geometria de fundo: o fundo de ruas vem do estilo `ultra-maptiler`, este aqui so carimba texto.",
    "ultra:tamanhos": "O texto e' DELIBERADAMENTE maior que o de um basemap de tela. Este mosaico e' buscado no MESMO zoom do frame (bump 0) e depois o PNG de 1280x760 ainda e' reduzido ao entrar no PDF; com os tamanhos de um estilo normal os nomes chegariam ao relatorio com ~3 pt.",
    "ultra:calibragem": "Tamanhos calibrados contra o PREVIEW REAL do frame de 1,5 km (mosaico reduzido ao map_box de 900 px) em 2026-07-29, com `zoom_bump=-1`. Nao sao tamanhos de basemap de tela: o mosaico ainda e ~2,5x mais denso que o PNG final, e o PNG e' reduzido de novo ao entrar no PDF.",
    "ultra:limite-do-dado": "O `brazil.mbtiles` e' z0-14 e no schema OpenMapTiles a camada `transportation_name` so traz nome de via MENOR a partir de z16. O tileserver rasteriza por overzoom, mas nao inventa dado: no frame do relatorio saem BAIRROS e AVENIDAS, nao ruas residenciais. A classe `residential` fica no filtro de proposito — passa a valer sozinha se um dia o mbtiles for regerado com maxzoom >= 16 (custo: horas de processamento e varios GB)."
  },
  "sources": {
    "openmaptiles": {
      "type": "vector",
      "url": "mbtiles://{brazil}"
    }
  },
  "glyphs": "{fontstack}/{range}.pbf",
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "fundo-transparente",
      "type": "background",
      "paint": {
        "background-color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rotulo-via-principal",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "openmaptiles",
      "source-layer": "transportation_name",
      "minzoom": 11,
      "filter": [
        "match",
        [
          "get",
          "class"
        ],
        [
          "motorway",
          "trunk",
          "primary",
          "secondary"
        ],
        true,
        false
      ],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": [
          "coalesce",
          [
            "get",
            "name:pt"
          ],
          [
            "get",
            "name"
          ]
        ],
        "text-font": [
          "Noto Sans Regular"
        ],
        "symbol-placement": "line",
        "text-rotation-alignment": "map",
        "text-size": [
          "interpolate",
          [
            "linear"
          ],
          [
            "zoom"
          ],
          11,
          18,
          14,
          26,
          17,
          32
        ],
        "text-max-angle": 35,
        "symbol-spacing": 320,
        "text-padding": 4
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "hsl(0,0%,12%)",
        "text-halo-color": "hsl(0,0%,100%)",
        "text-halo-width": 2.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rotulo-via-secundaria",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "openmaptiles",
      "source-layer": "transportation_name",
      "minzoom": 15,
      "filter": [
        "match",
        [
          "get",
          "class"
        ],
        [
          "tertiary",
          "minor",
          "residential"
        ],
        true,
        false
      ],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": [
          "coalesce",
          [
            "get",
            "name:pt"
          ],
          [
            "get",
            "name"
          ]
        ],
        "text-font": [
          "Noto Sans Regular"
        ],
        "symbol-placement": "line",
        "text-rotation-alignment": "map",
        "text-size": [
          "interpolate",
          [
            "linear"
          ],
          [
            "zoom"
          ],
          15,
          21,
          17,
          26
        ],
        "text-max-angle": 35,
        "symbol-spacing": 500,
        "text-padding": 4
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "hsl(0,0%,22%)",
        "text-halo-color": "hsl(0,0%,100%)",
        "text-halo-width": 2.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rotulo-bairro",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "openmaptiles",
      "source-layer": "place",
      "minzoom": 11,
      "filter": [
        "match",
        [
          "get",
          "class"
        ],
        [
          "suburb",
          "neighbourhood",
          "quarter",
          "village",
          "town",
          "city"
        ],
        true,
        false
      ],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": [
          "coalesce",
          [
            "get",
            "name:pt"
          ],
          [
            "get",
            "name"
          ]
        ],
        "text-font": [
          "Noto Sans Regular"
        ],
        "text-size": [
          "interpolate",
          [
            "linear"
          ],
          [
            "zoom"
          ],
          11,
          24,
          14,
          34,
          17,
          40
        ],
        "text-letter-spacing": 0.04,
        "text-padding": 6
      },
      "paint": {
